  m_text: "Cari\xF1osa is a cherished Filipino folk dance with deep Spanish roots,
    symbolizing the rich cultural exchange during the colonial period. Originating
    on Panay Island, this dance blends traditional Spanish elements with Filipino
    customs, offering a vibrant representation of the country's historical and cultural
    tapestry."
